## Empirical Benchmark Results

Below is a self-contained benchmark that measures `std::sort` vs. two custom QuickSort variants on 10,000,000 uniform `double` values. All tests were compiled with `-O2` (GSulcc 14.1.0, x86-64, Linux) and run on an AMD Ryzen 9 7950X.

